-- | Test-harness-local Emits SigOp (Plan 0.36 Phase 0/1 prerequisite).
-- NOT a real Strata interpretation — exists only so the effect-emitting
-- cata north-star tests can invoke an effectful op. Runtime = nop (the
-- companion Emit.x86_64's once_<sym> just returns); the observable is the
-- SigOp trace (asserted at the Agda `obs` level), not stdout.
signature emit : Eff Int Unit

-- | The same, for a Float — so a float LITERAL can be USED rather than merely
-- bound. A test that binds a float and ignores it is asking whether dead-code
-- elimination keeps it; a test that passes it to a SigOp is not asking that
-- question at all, and also exercises argument passing at the calling
-- convention. Runtime = nop, exactly like `emit`.
signature emitF : Eff Float Unit
